==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Wild Blaze|Roserade|9}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
*'''Poisonous Whip''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Poison Whip''' on {{TCG ID|Pokémon Web|Tangela|5}} from {{vg|Pokémon Trading Card Game}} for the [[Game Boy Color]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

